# Test code runs the parent configuration without the static analyzer. Catch2's CHECK_FALSE and
# REQUIRE_FALSE expand to enum casts the analyzer misreports, tests cast to out-of-range enums on
# purpose, and the sanitizers already run every test; the analyzer also quadruples a test file's
# lint time.
---
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: '-clang-analyzer-*'
